{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2021-12-14 17:00:00', 'title': 'THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY TO HOLD ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS ON MARCH 9, 2022', 'text': 'BURBANK, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS OF THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY (NYSE: DIS) WILL BE HELD ON WEDNESDAY, MARCH 9, 2022 AT 1:00 P.M. ET / 10:00 A.M. PT BY VIRTUAL MEETING AND WILL BE MADE AVAILABLE VIA WEBCAST AT WWW.DISNEY.COM/INVESTORS.'}